Package: distCUSUM
Type: Package
Title: Distance-Based CUSUM Statistics for High Dimensional Change Points
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Lupeng Zhang and Reza Drikvandi
Maintainer: Lupeng Zhang <lupengzhang9746@gmail.com>
Description: This package implements our distance-based CUSUM method for detecting
    single and multiple change points in high dimensional data. The main functions
    are called "DCCP_single_changepoint" and "DCCP_multiple_changepoints", which,
    respectively, run our algorithms for single change point detection and multiple
    change point detection using recursive binary segmentation. The modified L1 norm
    is used by default, and users can specify another relevant distance function.
    The function "DCCP" can also be used to calculate the proposed test statistic,
    distance matrix and CUSUM matrix. Also, the S&P500 and MIT cellphone data sets 
    analyzed in the paper are included.
